{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地演藝圈知名模範夫妻檔孫儷與鄧超結婚16年，育有1子1女，家庭生活一向受到外界熱烈關注。</p><p>日前，鄧超與鹿晗、陳赫等節目班底在南京舉辦音樂會活動《五哈嘉年華》，老婆孫儷特別帶兒女親臨現場應援。</p><p>母子三人現身台下的溫馨畫面曝光後，即將迎來15歲生</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:25:34.230164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:56:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:36.317926+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:36.317926+00:00","content_hash":"8a37cc8aa700c69131d11d6ac15a9e6be4dea96642b410c774b58a59cf0494f3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}